---
source: crates/assertrust/tests/cli.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
Catch changes that quietly weaken your test suite

Usage: assertrust <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check    Check a change for weakened tests
  changes  Show which commits and files a check would look at (for debugging)
  tests    Show the tests and checks assertrust finds in a file, or a CI or test config's gate facts (for debugging)
  pairs    Show how tests and checks pair up before and after a change (for debugging)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
